   "source": [
    "# Draw Steel Noticeboard: Technical Roadmap & Schema\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project:** Multi-instance Noticeboard with Discord Bot & React Frontend  \n",
    "**Core Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL)  \n",
    "**Backend:** FastAPI  \n",
    "**Integration:** Discord Bot (Admin/Posting) + React (OAuth/UI)\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. System Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "The system uses a centralized Supabase database to synchronize state between a Discord Bot (used for quick interactions/admin) and a React Web Dashboard (used for complex character management and OAuth).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Core Components\n",
    [cite_start]"* **Database:** Supabase (PostgreSQL) for relational data (instances) and JSONB storage (characters) [[cite: 1](combined_roadmap.ipynb)].\n",
    [cite_start]"* **API:** FastAPI backend acting as the single source of truth for both the Bot and Frontend [[cite: 1](combined_roadmap.ipynb)].\n",
    [cite_start]"* **Discord Bot:** Handles instance creation (Admin) and allows users to post notices using their registered characters [[cite: 3](context)].\n",
    [cite_start]"* **Frontend:** React app handling OAuth (Discord/Gmail) and `.ds-hero` file parsing [[cite: 2](context)]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Database Schema (SQL)\n",
    "\n",
    "The following SQL definitions establish the multi-instance capacity and the JSONB character storage required for the Draw Steel hero files.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Design Decisions\n",
    "1.  [cite_start]**`instances` Table:** Allows multiple distinct noticeboards to exist within one database, controlled by the Bot [[cite: 3](context)].\n",
    "2.  [cite_start]**`characters` Table:** Uses the `JSONB` data type to store the complex, nested structure of the Draw Steel export format (e.g., the \"Boris\" file) [[cite: 4](context)[cite_start], [cite: 5](Boris%20character(1).ds-hero)]."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "-- SQL Schema for Supabase / PostgreSQL\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 1. Enable UUID extension\n",
    "create extension if not exists \"uuid-ossp\";\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 2. USERS (Managed by Supabase Auth, but we reference auth.users)\n",
    "-- Note: In Supabase, 'auth.users' handles authentication. \n",
    "-- We can create a public profile table if extra metadata is needed.\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 3. INSTANCES (Multi-tenant boards)\n",
    "create table public.instances (\n",
    "  id uuid default uuid_generate_v4() primary key,\n",
    "  name text not null,\n",
    "  created_by uuid references auth.users(id) on delete set null,\n",
    "  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null,\n",
    "  is_active boolean default true\n",
    ");\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 4. DISCORD MAPPING (Links Discord Guilds to Instances)\n",
    "create table public.discord_instances (\n",
    "  id uuid default uuid_generate_v4() primary key,\n",
    "  instance_id uuid references public.instances(id) on delete cascade,\n",
    "  guild_id bigint not null unique, -- Discord Server ID\n",
    "  admin_role_id bigint, -- Optional: ID of the role allowed to manage the board\n",
    "  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null\n",
    ");\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 5. CHARACTERS (JSONB Storage for .ds-hero files)\n",
    "create table public.characters (\n",
    "  id uuid default uuid_generate_v4() primary key,\n",
    "  user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade,\n",
    "  name text not null, -- Extracted from JSON payload for easy query\n",
    "  data jsonb not null, -- Stores the full 'Boris' file content\n",
    "  created_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null\n",
    ");\n",
    "\n",
    "-- Indexing for performance on JSONB queries (e.g., finding all Revenants)\n",
    "create index idx_characters_data on public.characters using gin (data);\n",
    "\n",
    "-- 6. NOTICES (The content posts)\n",
    "create table public.notices (\n",
    "  id uuid default uuid_generate_v4() primary key,\n",
    "  instance_id uuid references public.instances(id) on delete cascade,\n",
    "  author_character_id uuid references public.characters(id) on delete set null,\n",
    "  content text not null,\n",
    "  posted_at timestamp with time zone default timezone('utc'::text, now()) not null\n",
    ");"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Backend Strategy (FastAPI)\n",
    "\n",
    "The backend will serve as the logic layer, validating the complex JSON character data before insertion.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Endpoints\n",
    "* **`POST /characters`**: \n",
    "    * Accepts the raw `.ds-hero` JSON.\n",
    "    * **Validation:** Must parse the JSON to ensure `id`, `name`, `ancestry`, and `class` keys exist. [cite_start]For example, validating the \"Revenant\" ancestry or \"Null\" class from the Boris file [[cite: 5](Boris%20character(1).ds-hero)].\n",
    "    * Extracts the character Name to the top-level SQL column.\n",
    "* **`POST /instances`**: \n",
    "    * Admin-protected route to spawn a new board.\n",
    "* **`GET /notices/{instance_id}`**: \n",
    "    * Returns notices joined with Character names and Ancestry types."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Frontend Roadmap (React)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Authentication\n",
    [cite_start]"* **OAuth Providers:** Discord and Google (Gmail) [[cite: 2](context)].\n",
    "* **Supabase Auth UI:** Use the pre-built Supabase Auth UI component for React to handle the redirect flows.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Character Uploader\n",
    "* **File Handler:** Implement a file input allowing `.ds-hero` or `.json` extensions.\n",
    "* **Parsing Logic:**\n",
    "    * Read `file.name` (e.g., \"Boris character\").\n",
    "    * Read `file.ancestry.name` (e.g., \"Revenant\").\n",
    "    * Read `file.class.name` (e.g., \"Null\").\n",
    "    * Send the full object to the Supabase `characters` table."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Discord Bot Workflow\n",
    "\n",
    "### Admin Features\n",
    [cite_start]"* **Instance Creation:** The admin user type defined in requirements [[cite: 3](context)] will use the bot command `/create_board [name]` to trigger the API.\n",
    "\n",
    "### User Features\n",
    "* **Posting:** Users map their Discord ID to their Supabase User ID (via OAuth). \n",
    "* **Command:** `/post [message] [character_name]`.\n",
    "    * The bot queries the `characters` table for a character matching `[character_name]` belonging to the user.\n",
    "    * If valid, posts to the `notices` table."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
